    "uncertainty": {
      "note": "ORIAS section headings give 1325 (to Cairo), 1326 (Cairo, Mecca), 1334–1341 (Delhi), 1345–1346 (China) and 1346–1349 (return home); Saudi Aramco World gives the return to Tangier in 1349. Other pages seen in search results give other years for Delhi; they were not opened."
